</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Getting wrong color space for inline images because of abbreviations. (PDF Reference 1.4, chapter 4.8.6). <br/>
According to specification inline images can use directly (not by names) only 4 color spaces: DeviceGray (Gray), DeviceCMYK (CMYK), DeviceRGB (RGB), Indexed (I).
  </td>
