                <tr id="issuerow12902413" rel="12902413" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-3005" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-3005" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-3005">PDFBOX-3005</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Incorrect property names for lists
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Maruan Sahyoun
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Evgeniy Muravitskiy
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Evgeniy Muravitskiy
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 05/Oct/15 12:45 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 17/Mar/16 19:08 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 07/Oct/15 16:42 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Writing,                     XmpBox            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">4</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When i write code as follows:<br/>
{code}<br/>
PDDocument document = PDDocument.load(new File(FILE_PATH));<br/>
DomXmpParser parser = new DomXmpParser();<br/>
XMPMetadata metadata = parser.parse(document.getDocumentCatalog().getMetadata().getStream().getUnfilteredStream());<br/>
metadata.removeSchema(metadata.getPDFIdentificationSchema());<br/>
OutputStream res = new FileOutputStream(RESULT_XML);<br/>
new XmpSerializer().serialize(metadata, res, true);<br/>
{code}<br/>
I got xml which contain following tag:<br/>
{code}<br/>
&lt;dc:creator&gt;<br/>
    &lt;rdf:Seq&gt;<br/>
        &lt;rdf:creator&gt;Tomioka, Satoshi&lt;/rdf:creator&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/rdf:Seq&gt;<br/>
&lt;/dc:creator&gt;<br/>
{code}<br/>
but instead of {{rdf:creator}} must be {{rdf:li}}. This problem reproducible also for others DublinCoreShema properties which contains lists.
  </td>
