                <tr id="issuerow12905216" rel="12905216" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-3027" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-3027" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-3027">PDFBOX-3027</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Incorrect enumeration of conformances for PDFAIdentificationSchema
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Maruan Sahyoun
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Evgeniy Muravitskiy
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Evgeniy Muravitskiy
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 15/Oct/15 14:55 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 17/Mar/16 19:06 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 15/Oct/15 17:25 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        XmpBox            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">4</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      {{PDFAIdentificationSchema.setConformance(String)}} make next check for input data:<br/>
{code}<br/>
if (value.equals(&quot;A&quot;) || value.equals(&quot;B&quot;))<br/>
{<br/>
TextType conf = createTextType(CONFORMANCE, value);<br/>
addProperty(conf);<br/>
}<br/>
else<br/>
{<br/>
throw new ....<br/>
}<br/>
{code}<br/>
but for PDF/A-2 and PDF/A-3 exist 3 conformances: A, B, U.<br/>
[Proof link for PDF/A-2 | http://www.pdfa.org/wp-content/uploads/2011/10/Flyer-PDFA2-Overview-EN.pdf]
  </td>
