                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      See https://github.com/apache/pdfbox/blob/trunk/examples/src/main/java/org/apache/pdfbox/examples/util/PrintTextLocations.java#L106<br/>
<br/>
It references the &quot;pdmodel&quot; package instead of &quot;util&quot;<br/>
<br/>
A better solution would be to do PrintTextLocations.class.getName() instead of hardcoding<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
Edit: same problem in several other examples, e.g. PrintImageLocations.
