<br/>
By @Tilman Hausherr<br/>
I&#39;m expanding this as a long term issue to improve the testing of text extraction. Todos:<br/>
- don&#39;t fail immediately (this makes it easier to create output files the first time)<br/>
- make a diff output in output dir<br/>
- get / create sample files to ensure certain capabilities are tested<br/>

