                                            <td class="description">      I experience a problem opening PDFs created by pdfbox.<br/>
The file is password protected. <br/>
Opening them with evince, I get the following messages:<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
rjung$ evince generatedfile.pdf <br/>
Syntax Error (1074): Illegal character &#39;&gt;&#39;<br/>
Command Line Error: Incorrect password<br/>
Syntax Error (1074): Illegal character &#39;&gt;&#39;<br/>
Syntax Error: Unterminated string<br/>
Syntax Error: Leftover args in content stream<br/>
Syntax Error: Unterminated string<br/>
