                                            <td class="description">      I&#39;d like to experiment with writing my own text extractor that works better for my use case than PDFTextStripper does. Hopefully I can port some of the improvements to PDFTextStripper if I get something working well. I&#39;d really like PDFTextStreamEngine and its constructor to have increased visibility as I believe that it&#39;s pretty reasonable for people to be able write their own PDFTextStrippers without having to reimplement showGlyph.
