                <tr id="issuerow12908606" rel="12908606" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-3068" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-3068" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-3068">PDFBOX-3068</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
            <span class="parentIssue">PDFBOX-3058</span>
                Null metadata in 2.0 in some files that had metadata in 1.8.10 with old parser
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Sub-task</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Tim Allison
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Tim Allison
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 28/Oct/15 15:44 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 18/Jan/16 12:01 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 31/Oct/15 11:42 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.8.10,                     1.8.11,                     2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.8.11,                     2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Parsing            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">5</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Tilman&#39;s observation on &#39;Microsoft&#39; below revealed 1) that we should use our BodyContentHandler so that title metadata doesn&#39;t slip into the body content and 2) the title and all metadata values from PDDocumentInformation is null for at least: NZ/NZAZKTQYKDD2HSBCSJJN6XSEA4KJEONU<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
        Path p = Paths.get(&quot;..NZAZKTQYKDD2HSBCSJJN6XSEA4KJEONU&quot;);<br/>
        PDDocument d = PDDocument.load(p.toFile());<br/>
        assertNull(d.getDocumentInformation().getTitle());<br/>
        assertEquals(8, d.getDocumentInformation().getMetadataKeys().size());<br/>
{code} <br/>
<br/>
Manually reviewing a handful of documents in the metadata/metadata_value_count_diffs.csv file [here|https://github.com/tballison/share/blob/master/pdfbox_comparisons/pdfbox_1_8_10V2_0_20151023.zip], this looks to be quite pervasive...unless I&#39;m botching the right way to load the documents and metadata.
  </td>
