                                            <td class="description">      {code}<br/>
java.lang.ClassCastException: org.apache.pdfbox.cos.COSObject cannot be cast to org.apache.pdfbox.cos.COSBoolean<br/>
    org.apache.pdfbox.pdmodel.graphics.shading.AxialShadingContext.&lt;init&gt;(AxialShadingContext.java:92)<br/>
    org.apache.pdfbox.pdmodel.graphics.shading.AxialShadingPaint.createContext(AxialShadingPaint.java:67)<br/>
{code}<br/>
Same bug as in ghostscript: extends as references. Fix by using getObject() instead of get().<br/>

