                <tr id="issuerow12913112" rel="12913112" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-3108" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-3108" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-3108">PDFBOX-3108</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Font cache is always rebuilt when font skipped
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 14/Nov/15 22:01 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 17/Mar/16 19:08 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 17/Nov/15 17:35 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        FontBox            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      If a font is skipped because of a missing name, the font is not added to the fontInfoList. This means that at the next program start, the list will be rebuilt.<br/>
<br/>
This has happened for me all the time, I&#39;m just too patient so I didn&#39;t realize the problem. It happens with the attached font, which is on my system.<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
There should be a type of entry in the cache file that mentions a file, but no font name, so that the next time the font directories are looked into, that file is not considered to be a new font.
  </td>
