                                            <td class="description">      Hello. We have a requirement to be able to sign huge pdf files consisting entirely from paper scans. Unfortunately current implementation unnecessary buffers entire pdf contents during signing procedure. This patch suggests a fix.<br/>
<br/>
We&#39;ll be happy to adjust it if needed and to see it merged. 
