                                            <td class="description">      Text extraction using PrintTextLocations is getting garbled characters in the attached snippet. <br/>
<br/>
For this file it is getting one string of &quot;2O(Er4env vqeheurosriAurseirueeass ss/Ct:7:rh adaliaargynse csr eadc+cit6e l1ipc te+2en 6d9c1)9e 91 2933&quot;<br/>
<br/>
