                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The file from PDFBOX-2563 looks different depending on whether the cache exists, because a different fallback font is used:<br/>
<br/>
After deleting .pdfbox.cache:<br/>
{quote}<br/>
Using fallback font Batang for CID-keyed TrueType font ????<br/>
{quote}<br/>
<br/>
Second run with existing cache:<br/>
{quote}<br/>
