                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I have problem with multiline fields in form filling. It seems that if i have value with newlines &quot;\n&quot; rendering won&#39;t work correctly. Every line seems to be rendered over previous line. <br/>
<br/>
E.g. <br/>
{code}<br/>
value = &quot;1\n2\n3\n4&quot;<br/>
{code}<br/>
will be rendered so than every number are rendered over each other but what I&#39;m expecting would be something like:<br/>
{code}<br/>
1<br/>
2<br/>
3<br/>
4<br/>
{code}
