</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Observed on both Linux and Mac
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      When I run pdfbox-app ExtractImages on a PDF containing an image with a DeviceRGB colorspace, the resulting JPEG file is very large (5.3MB, while the source PDF is 320KB).<br/>
<br/>
I see this with the 2.0.0-RC2 release, I also encounter the problem with a build from today&#39;s trunk.<br/>
<br/>
If I modify the code to force usage of ImageIO, a valid JPEG file results.<br/>
<br/>
The image extracts properly in the 1.8.10 version.
  </td>
