</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      In 1.8 the PDVisibleSignDesigner constructor took a JPEG stream and used that one directly to create a PDJpeg. In 2.0  the stream is read into a BufferedImage so the opportunity to create a JPEG directly is lost. But this doesn&#39;t matter, as a JPEG is not the best choice for images with sharp edges (a signature scan, or a text printed into an image). So I will<br/>
- replace the JPEGFactory with LosslessFactoory<br/>
- add constructor that takes a BufferedImage
  </td>
