</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                No glyph for U+0009 in font ArialUnicodeMS
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Critical
</td>
