                                            <td class="environment">      Windows7, Jdeveloper 10
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi,<br/>
<br/>
I am getting &quot;No glyph for U+0009 in font ArialUnicodeMS&quot; while i am trying to write the data into PDF using PDFBOX. I am currently using PDFBOX 2.0 and FONTBOX 2.0 version. I tried many ways but i am unable to find the solution for this CHARACTER TABULATION. It will be fine if i can replace this character with space. I am forced to use arial unicode MS font which will support this character but still getting this error. Can you please help me to handle this ? I am trying to flush the data using web service.<br/>
<br/>
Thanks in advance .!<br/>

