                <tr id="issuerow12922382" rel="12922382" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-3169" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-3169" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-3169">PDFBOX-3169</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                SaveIncremental does not work without signature
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Thomas Chojecki
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Thomas Chojecki
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Thomas Chojecki
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 16/Dec/15 13:39 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 17/Mar/16 19:07 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 17/Dec/15 11:37 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Writing            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">3</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I know this feature is ongoing, but with the 2.0.0-RC builds the saveIncremental (without signature) stop working at all. A ByteArrayOutputStream is used in the COSWriter for output. This OutputStream will only be handled in the case, when we write a signature. Otherwise the whole content will be discarded.<br/>
<br/>
As I wrote some time ago on the mailinglist, incremental update work in a limited way. At the moment we use it for augmenting signatures and this works with the old 1.8.x but not with trunk after the patch PDFBOX-1847 was applied.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
