                <tr id="issuerow12933196" rel="12933196" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-3204" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-3204" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-3204">PDFBOX-3204</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                JVM crashes on PDFRenderer.renderImageWithDPI
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Amos Ng
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Amos Ng
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 21/Jan/16 22:31 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 17/Mar/16 19:07 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 25/Jan/16 20:57 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.8.10,                     2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.8.12,                     2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Rendering            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">2</td>
                                            <td class="watches">5</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        PDFBOX-2373,                                                PDFBOX-2929                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Oracle Java 8 update 71, on both Mac OS X Yosemite and Ubuntu 14.04 LTS. Does not happen on OpenJDK 8.
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      When running the following Scala program on one of the attached PDFs:<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
import org.apache.pdfbox.pdmodel.PDDocument<br/>
import org.apache.pdfbox.rendering.PDFRenderer<br/>
import java.io.File<br/>
<br/>
object FigureExtractorBatchCli {<br/>
  def main(args: Array[String]): Unit = {<br/>
    new PDFRenderer(PDDocument.load(new File(&quot;problem.pdf&quot;))).renderImageWithDPI(0, 195)<br/>
  }<br/>
}<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
a fatal error occurs with the JVM at [the call to java.awt.Graphics2D.draw|https://github.com/apache/pdfbox/blob/6f3417a1863b308a9ce48722c2da1d62f09c9a35/pdfbox/src/main/java/org/apache/pdfbox/rendering/PageDrawer.java#L578].<br/>
<br/>
For *problem.pdf* this only happens at a DPI &gt;= 195. For *problem2.pdf* it&#39;s DPI &gt;= 5. For *problem3.pdf* it happens at any DPI.
  </td>
