                                            <td class="environment">      2.0.0-RC3
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      The class {{org.apache.pdfbox.multipdf.Overlay}} has no possibility to perform the overlay only in memory (using a custom {{OutputStream}}). It is currently fixed to work with files only.<br/>
<br/>
A suggestion would be to add an overload {{public void overlay(Map&lt;Integer, String&gt; specificPageOverlayFile, OutputStream outStream) throws IOException}} which uses the outStream if supplied and falls back to {{outputFilename}} if null is passed (would be an easy solution)<br/>
  
  </td>
