                <tr id="issuerow12933782" rel="12933782" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-3212" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-3212" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-3212">PDFBOX-3212</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                PDPageContentStream - give possibility to prepend content
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> New Feature</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Duplicate
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Philip Helger
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Philip Helger
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 25/Jan/16 11:25 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 25/Jan/16 12:17 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 25/Jan/16 12:17 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        PDModel            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        PDFBOX-3084                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      2.0.0-RC3
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Currently {{PDPageContentStream}} has the possibility to overwrite existing content or to append content to it.<br/>
What would be nice is to also prepend content (e.g. for watermarking).<br/>
Therefore I locally changed the constructor parameter {{boolean appendContent}} to an enum:<br/>
{code}<br/>
  public static enum EAppendMode<br/>
  {<br/>
    OVERWRITE,  APPEND,  PREPEND;<br/>
    public boolean isNotOverwrite () {<br/>
      return this != OVERWRITE;<br/>
    }<br/>
    public boolean isPrepend () {<br/>
      return this == PREPEND;<br/>
    }<br/>
  }<br/>
{code}<br/>
Of coure this means an incompatibility in the parameter list.<br/>
If you are interested to follow that path I can provide you with a patch (providing API compatibility).<br/>
If you think this idea is bullshit, just close it...
  </td>
