but when i convert some tiff files to pdf, i&#39;ve got a some error message.<br/>
like this: &quot;java.io.IOException: First image in tiff is not CCITT T4 or T6 compressed&quot;<br/>
<br/>
I couldn&#39;t find this solution of this error message in &quot;stackoverflow.com&quot; and PDFBOX issue in JIRA.<br/>
<br/>
So. i attach my Java Files(pdf-&gt;image, image-&gt;pdf), TIFF image and PDF file.<br/>
<br/>
Please let me know how can i resolve that message.
