                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      NOTE: actual version is 2.0.0-RC3<br/>
<br/>
In PDAcroForm#getDefaultResources existing resources are created like this:<br/>
{code}<br/>
        COSDictionary dr = (COSDictionary) dictionary.getDictionaryObject(COSName.DR);<br/>
        if (dr != null)<br/>
        {<br/>
            retval = new PDResources(dr);<br/>
        }<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
PDResources supports resource cache but default resources is always created without one.<br/>

  </td>
