</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Merging fails on certain pdfs with form-fields
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Critical
