                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I&#39;m the maintainer of openhtmltopdf which is a fork of flying saucer that uses pdf box 2 instead of itext.<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;m having a blocking issue where there seems to be no way to implement text justification using pdf box. So if I ask very nicely I thought a pdf box maintainer could add the text spacing and space spacing operator to the content stream class.<br/>
<br/>
Thankyou.<br/>
https://github.com/danfickle/openhtmltopdf
