                                            <td class="description">      When using a couple of different Courier fonts, if I insert the character &#39;ö&#39; into a line of the pdf any other line that uses the same font will no longer display. Other styles of the same font still work fine.<br/>
<br/>
Example file:<br/>
bq. http://s000.tinyupload.com/?file_id=72100196724522466317<br/>
<br/>
This happens in 1.8.8, 1.8.11, and the unreleased 1.8.12 but does not happen in 2.0.0. To display the PDF I&#39;ve been using the pdfbox app jars for the respective versions which gives the following error:<br/>
