                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      A form filling issue was discussed on the users mailing list where one of the issues was that the widget annotations do not contain a /P entry. <br/>
<br/>
This led to an NPE:<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
Exception in thread &quot;main&quot; java.lang.NullPointerException<br/>
	at org.apache.pdfbox.pdmodel.PDPageContentStream.&lt;init&gt;(PDPageContentStream.java:195)<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
As the /P entry is an optional entry the code would not opened on that entry.
