                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      From Alexander K. on the mailing list:<br/>
{quote}<br/>
Situation: We have a bunch of PDF/A-1b compliant documents from a 3rd <br/>
party system and merge them into a new document. The end result is not <br/>
PDF/A-1b compliant though.<br/>
{quote}<br/>
The cause is that the outputIntents are ignored. But if all are copied, the file isn&#39;t valid either because only one outputIntent is allowed.
