                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        PDFBOX-3329                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When merging multiple PDFs into one compound document via {{PDFMergerUtility}}, meta data like title, author, subject cannot be set but seem to be taken from one of the input documents. This is usually not the desired behaviour because as a user I have no direct influence on the meta data. As a user I would like to explicitly set or at least overwrite certain meta data for the destination document. Currently I can only set the destination stream or file name, but not the meta data.
