  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      For some reason pdfbox is trying to access C:\windows\sytem32\inetsrv   folder. <br/>
We are usinf pdfbox to parse pdf files in our sitecore based CMS website. <br/>
This folder is locked in production servers, giving access is a security hole.<br/>
Here is what we see in event logs:<br/>
CreateFile    C:\windows\sytem32\inetsrv\org\apache\pdfbox\resources\cmap\WinansiEncoding    PATH NOT FOUND Desired Access: Read Attributes<br/>
Let me know if more details are needed.<br/>
 
