        at org.apache.pdfbox.rendering.PDFRenderer.renderImage(PDFRenderer.java:108)<br/>
        at org.apache.pdfbox.rendering.PDFRenderer.renderImageWithDPI(PDFRenderer.java:94)<br/>
<br/>
Unfortunately, I can&#39;t attach the image because it&#39;s proprietary. I haven&#39;t included my code because it&#39;s rendering other things files OK.
