                <tr id="issuerow12972781" rel="12972781" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-3363" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-3363" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-3363">PDFBOX-3363</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Leftover file in temp directory when signing
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 25/May/16 17:21 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 25/Mar/17 18:12 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 25/May/16 17:37 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.1,                     2.0.2,                     3.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.2,                     3.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Signing            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      As reported by Damien Butaye on the mailing list:<br/>
{quote}<br/>
   I&#39;m trying to add a signature to a PDF using PDFBOX 2.0.1. During the<br/>
process, a tmp file (e.g: tmpPDFBoxXXX.pdf) is stored inside the /tmp<br/>
directory (RehHat server). This file is not deleted after completion.<br/>
After some checks, it seems that the object responsible of the file<br/>
creation is  &quot;RandomAccessBufferedFileInputStream(InputStream is)&quot;. This<br/>
object is used by the PDFParser object which doesn&#39;t close the stream<br/>
after<br/>
completion.<br/>
{quote}<br/>
and his solution:<br/>
{quote}<br/>
 For your information I found a workaround to avoid the problem of tmp file<br/>
deletion. In the SignatureOptions object, I modified the method  *public<br/>
void setVisualSignature(InputStream is)  *with the following content :<br/>
<br/>
      RandomAccessBufferedFileInputStream tmp=new<br/>
RandomAccessBufferedFileInputStream(is); --&gt; NEW LINE<br/>
         PDFParser parser = new PDFParser(tmp);  --&gt; NEW LINE<br/>
         parser.parse();<br/>
         visualSignature = parser.getDocument();<br/>
         tmp.close();  --&gt; NEW LINE<br/>
<br/>
Tmp files are well deleted and all unit tests passed without error on the<br/>
pdfbox maven project.<br/>
{quote}
  </td>
