                <tr id="issuerow12973100" rel="12973100" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-3364" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-3364" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-3364">PDFBOX-3364</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                PDModel.getSignatureFields() only returns top level signature fields
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Maruan Sahyoun
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Maruan Sahyoun
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Maruan Sahyoun
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 26/May/16 15:25 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 25/Mar/17 18:12 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/May/16 18:36 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.0,                     2.0.1,                     2.0.2,                     3.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.2,                     3.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        PDModel            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">3</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      From the users mailing list<br/>
<br/>
{quote}<br/>
I&#39;m tying to rewrite my code in order to use the PDFBox in place of the<br/>
current library.<br/>
First of all, thank you for the great work you are doing!<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;m trying to manage signatures of a PDFdocuments and the method that I use<br/>
to obtain the Signatures&#39; list from the PDDocument is:<br/>
<br/>
public List&lt;PDSignature&gt; *getSignatureDictionaries *() throws IOException<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;m in trouble with a specific signed PDF document because this method<br/>
returns an empty signature list.<br/>
{quote}<br/>
<br/>
The user correctly spotted that we only return top level fields and not descendant fields (as can be seen from the source code).
  </td>
