  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I&#39;m trying to convert PDF to Image.<br/>
<br/>
When I call PDFRenderer.renderImage(), the log message like belows appears.<br/>
<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
 WARN(FileSystemFontProvider.java)[2016-06-10 10:44:39,969]-New fonts found, font cache will be re-built<br/>
 WARN(FileSystemFontProvider.java)[2016-06-10 10:44:39,969]-Building on-disk font cache, this may take a while<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
<br/>
It never stops. No response or change since those message appears.<br/>
<br/>
I can&#39;t attach font cache file because I don&#39;t know where it is located.<br/>
<br/>
+ I attached pdfbox tmp file &quot;pdfbox377219359369560029tmp&quot; that I found in /tmp/ directory.<br/>
<br/>
tail of the file is like belows<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
