                                            <td class="description">      Some PDF / Adobe Illustrator files have their art off center.  In some of these cases, the page ArtBox is reported the right size but the wrong position.<br/>
<br/>
PDPage aiPage = aiDoc.getPage(0);<br/>
PDRectangle ArtBox = aiPage.getArtBox();<br/>
<br/>
I need the correct coordinates for the ArtBox in order to center the art within the window of my application.<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;ll happily patch the code ... but if you have pointers to identify what&#39;s messing up the ArtBox coordinates, those are appreciated.
