                                            <td class="description">      {code}<br/>
java.lang.OutOfMemoryError: Java heap space<br/>
	at java.awt.image.DataBufferByte.&lt;init&gt;(DataBufferByte.java:92) ~[na:1.8.0_66]<br/>
