  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Whenever I am trying to render the PDF into images with:<br/>
<br/>
renderer.renderImageWithDPI(i, resolution, imageType)<br/>
<br/>
I run into this error:<br/>
<br/>
Warning: Could not read embedded TTF for font ....<br/>
<br/>
This happens with any PDF that has been generated from any of the LibreOffice suite and even happens with an empty PDF which has been generated.<br/>
<br/>
I think PDFBox is having trouble reading the embedded fonts within the document but I need this fixed urgently for this project I am working on.<br/>
<br/>
Kind regards
