                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      org/apache/pdfbox/pdmodel/interactive/digitalsignature/visible/PDVisibleSignDesigner.java contains the following in the calculatePageSize method:<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
    float x = pageWidth;<br/>
    float y = 0;<br/>
    pageWidth += y;<br/>
    float tPercent = (100 * y / (x + y));<br/>
    imageSizeInPercents = 100 - tPercent;<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
I can&#39;t see how this would result in anything but an imageSizeInPercents of 100.<br/>

  </td>
