                <tr id="issuerow12989137" rel="12989137" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-3421" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-3421" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-3421">PDFBOX-3421</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Optimize float to string conversion in PDAbstractContentStream
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Trivial
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Michael Doswald
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Michael Doswald
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 13/Jul/16 14:41 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 25/Mar/17 18:12 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 19/Jul/16 16:05 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.2,                     2.0.3,                     3.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.3,                     3.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        PDModel            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">3</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Ubuntu 14.04
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Drawing lines in a PDF (and also other operations) writes the coordinates to the content stream. Currently, the PDAbstractContentStream#writeOperand(float) method uses the NumberFormat class to convert the float values. This is inefficient for multiple reasons:<br/>
<br/>
* NumberFormat is designed to format numbers locale dependent. That is not needed in this case<br/>
* NumberFormat uses a pattern to format the value which is also not needed in this case<br/>
* The formatting first creates a String object, converts it to a byte array with ASCII encoding and then writes it to the stream. This generates a lot of garbage.<br/>
<br/>
A different approach to formatting real operands should be used.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimespent"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="labels">    optimization, performance</td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12310220">            <span title="13/Jul/16 17:04"><time class="livestamp allow-future" datetime="2016-07-13T17:04:47+0000">13/Jul/16 5:04 PM</time></span>
    </td>
