                                            <td class="description">      I&#39;m trying to render well the attached pdf. At the beginning, the rendering result was white pages but when I added the external libraries, I succeeded to have a visual result.<br/>
Unfortunately, I got some huge black pixels in the image. Do you have an idea where they come from? Is there a way to set a rendering parameter to avoid this?<br/>
Thank you in advance!<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
&lt;/dependency&gt;<br/>
       &lt;dependency&gt;<br/>
       &lt;groupId&gt;com.github.jai-imageio&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
