                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When outputting text with a PDPageContentStream I&#39;d like to set the rendering mode (particularly to invisible/RenderingMode.NEITHER). Use of PDPageContentStream.appendRawCommands(&quot;3 Tr&quot;), is deprecated in PDFBox version 2.0.2. I suggest to implement something like a setRenderingMode on PDPageContentStream as an enhancement.
