                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When filling AcroForm fields the text supplied to {{setValue}} might contain control characters such as {{\n}} {{\r}}, {{\t}} and others which leads to an {{ java.lang.IllegalArgumentException}} for most fonts as there is no glyph to represent these.<br/>
<br/>
We could enhance the processing of the string provided to provide proper replacements similar to how Adobe Acrobat handles that. 
