                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      It seems that while the Label is being saved correctly with setlabel() it is impossible to read it back.<br/>
<br/>
Looking at the source <br/>
{code}<br/>
    public void setLabel( String label )<br/>
    {<br/>
        setTextProperty( prefix + &quot;:Label&quot;, label );<br/>
    }<br/>
    <br/>
    public String getLabel()<br/>
    {<br/>
        return getTextProperty( prefix + &quot;p:Label&quot; );<br/>
    }<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
It is quite obvious that the problem is the p in &quot;p:Label&quot; .
  </td>
