                <tr id="issuerow12998047" rel="12998047" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-3467" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-3467" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-3467">PDFBOX-3467</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                PDPage.getAnnotations() modifies the PDF
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            John Hewson
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            John Hewson
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            John Hewson
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 17/Aug/16 22:39 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 17/Sep/16 09:45 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 18/Aug/16 17:05 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.3            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        PDModel            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I stumbled across this bug while using PDFDebugger.<br/>
<br/>
PDPage.getAnnotations() writes to the Page&#39;s COSDictionary, adding a new Annots entry if it is missing.<br/>
<br/>
This violates one of the rules which we introduced for 2.0, that reading from a PDF file should not result in the file&#39;s COS model being modified.
  </td>
