                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      If malformed PDF/A identification metadata without {{&lt;pdfaid:part&gt;}} element is present, Preflight PDFAIdentificationValidation throws NPE:<br/>
{code:xml}<br/>
java.lang.NullPointerException<br/>
	at org.apache.pdfbox.preflight.metadata.PDFAIdentificationValidation.validatePDFAIdentifer(PDFAIdentificationValidation.java:85)<br/>
...<br/>
{code}<br/>
PDFAIdentificationValidation.checkPartNumber() method should register an error instead.
  </td>
