  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Rendering a page with the method renderImage(int pageIndex, float scale) in PDFRenderer with a scale factor &lt; 1 (e.g 0.5) the image renders only 0.5 of the actual content<br/>
{code}<br/>
try {<br/>
	File file = new File(&quot;input.pdf&quot;);<br/>
	PDDocument document = PDDocument.load(file);<br/>
	PDFRenderer renderer = new PDFRenderer(document);<br/>
	BufferedImage image = renderer.renderImage(0, .5f);<br/>
	ImageIO.write(image, &quot;png&quot;, new File(&quot;output.png&quot;));<br/>
} catch (IOException e) {<br/>
	e.printStackTrace();<br/>
}<br/>
{code}
