                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        PDFBOX-2990,                                                PDFBOX-3369                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      As reported by Simon Gaeremynck in the user mailing list with attached file. <br/>
{code}<br/>
[3] Stack trace:<br/>
[error] at org.apache.pdfbox.cos.COSFloat.&lt;init&gt;(COSFloat.java:81)<br/>
[error] at org.apache.pdfbox.cos.COSNumber.get(COSNumber.java:115)<br/>
[error] at org.apache.pdfbox.pdfparser.BaseParser.parseDirObject(BaseParser.java:939)<br/>
{code}<br/>
His proposed change in COSFloat<br/>
{code}<br/>
-            if (aFloat.matches(&quot;^0\\.0+\\-\\d+&quot;))<br/>
+            if (aFloat.matches(&quot;^0\\.0*\\-\\d+&quot;))<br/>
{code}<br/>
I&#39;ll commit it after running regression tests.
