                                            <td class="description">      Using PdfBox 1.8.12 we are extracting character coordinates from [^test_width1.pdf], as described in PDFBOX-3464<br/>
We got two issues here:<br/>
- wrong height, this issue was already addressed by PDFBOX-3464<br/>
- wrong width and X positions of characters, which we are getting from PdfBox via the code:<br/>
{code} <br/>
   position.getX();<br/>
   position.getWidth();<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
The coordinates, returned by PdfBox shown on [^screenshot-1.png] with blue color.<br/>
This code works fine on most PDFs. Something is wrong with this specific PDF. <br/>
<br/>

