                                            <td class="description">      I&#39;ve a private pdf containing 1900 tiny inline images (CMYK, 8bit) which renders way too slow. Again the CMYK2RGB conversion is the culprit here, BUT the known issue with the KCMS/LCMS change isn&#39;t the main problem here.<br/>
