  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      We came across this font http://www.myfontfree.com/def_writer___base_cyr-myfontfreecom126f65213.htm where the font name is *Def Writer | BASE Cyr* containing the separator used in the font cache and finally resulting in <br/>
{code}<br/>
java.lang.ExceptionInInitializerError<br/>
	at org.apache.pdfbox.pdmodel.font.FontMapperImpl.getProvider(FontMapperImpl.java:149)<br/>
	at org.apache.pdfbox.pdmodel.font.FontMapperImpl.findFont(FontMapperImpl.java:413)<br/>
