                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      PDF reported by Ford Wang in the mailing list. The &quot;herbs&quot; have weird purple dots. The cause are DCTDecode (jpeg) images with a separation colorspace, e.g. {{Root/Pages/Kids/\[0]/Resources/XObject/Im5267}} . The image itself is a grayscale image, i.e. it has only one color component. The separation colorspace is a green (PANTONE 355 C), which is based on an Lab colorspace.
