                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When FDF data is saved the resulting xml file defines UTF-8 as encoding but the file itself is saved using the default file encoding which isn&#39;t necessarily UTF-8
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimespent"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeestimate"></td>
