                                            <td class="environment">      windows 10
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I have defined a date field in my PDF with the format &quot;dd.mm.yyyy&quot;. Reading the value (field.getValueAsString()) works as expected if the input is a whole date string.<br/>
Now when I set the field to e.g. &quot;10.10&quot; the value is accepted and displayed as &quot;10.10.2016&quot; (probably always the current year). But when I try to read the field it always delivers null and not what is displayed in the PDF.
