java.io.IOException: java.security.InvalidKeyException: Illegal key size<br/>
--at org.apache.pdfbox.pdmodel.encryption.StandardSecurityHandler.prepareEncryptionDictRev6(StandardSecurityHandler.java:486)<br/>
--at org.apache.pdfbox.pdmodel.encryption.StandardSecurityHandler.prepareDocumentForEncryption(StandardSecurityHandler.java:390)<br/>
--at org.apache.pdfbox.pdfwriter.COSWriter.write(COSWriter.java:1305)<br/>
--at org.apache.pdfbox.pdfwriter.COSWriter.write(COSWriter.java:1254)<br/>
--at org.apache.pdfbox.pdmodel.PDDocument.save(PDDocument.java:1232)<br/>
<br/>
Could you please help me on that issue?<br/>
<br/>
Here under some details : <br/>
<br/>
java version &quot;1.6.0&quot;<br/>
Java(TM) SE Runtime Environment (build pap6460sr16fp7ifix-20150930_02(SR16 FP7+IV77565))<br/>
