                <tr id="issuerow13038877" rel="13038877" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-3669" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-3669" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-3669">PDFBOX-3669</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                PDPageContentStream: Add setMiterLimit()
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> New Feature</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Emmeran Seehuber
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Emmeran Seehuber
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 30/Jan/17 12:04 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 25/Mar/17 18:13 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 30/Jan/17 19:43 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.4            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.5,                     3.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Writing            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">1</td>
                                            <td class="watches">3</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Currently PDPageContentStream has no method to set the miter limit. At the moment one has to resort to<br/>
{code}<br/>
contentStream.appendRawCommands(11f + &quot; M &quot;);<br/>
{code}<br/>
as workaround. But appendRawCommand() is deprecated, so there should be a official method to do so:<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
    /**<br/>
     * Set the miter limit.<br/>
     *<br/>
     * @param miterLimit the new miter limit.<br/>
     * @throws IOException If the content stream could not be written.<br/>
     */ <br/>
    public void setMiterLimit(float miterLimit) throws IOException<br/>
    {<br/>
        if (inTextMode)<br/>
        {<br/>
            throw new IllegalStateException(&quot;Error: setMiterLimit is not allowed within a text block.&quot;);<br/>
        }<br/>
        writeOperand(miterLimit);<br/>
        writeOperator(&quot;M&quot;);<br/>
    }<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
Please add this method to PDPageContentStream. Thank you.<br/>

  </td>
