                                            <td class="environment">      Windows 10, java version &quot;1.8.0_25&quot;
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Text extraction from certain PDFs is not possible and PDF Box responses with NullPointerException. Text extraction from same PDF with version 1.8.13 is working. <br/>
<br/>
Originally the issue was discovered while using the newest Apache Tika 1.14 library. I can not down-grade to PDF Box 1.8.13 with Apache Tika 1.14.<br/>
<br/>
Unfortunately I can not provide the PDFs that fail to you. However, I did some testing and found out that “Token token = lexer.nextToken();” return Null.<br/>
<br/>
Feb 07, 2017 12:17:40 PM org.apache.pdfbox.pdmodel.font.PDType1Font &lt;init&gt;<br/>
SEVERE: Can&#39;t read the embedded Type1 font AAAAAB+Arial-BoldMT<br/>
java.io.IOException: Found token=null but expected NAME<br/>
<br/>
Caused by: java.io.EOFException<br/>
	at org.apache.pdfbox.io.ScratchFileBuffer.seek(ScratchFileBuffer.java:302)<br/>
	at org.apache.pdfbox.pdfparser.COSParser.checkXRefOffset(COSParser.java:1177)<br/>
	at org.apache.pdfbox.pdfparser.COSParser.parseXref(COSParser.java:202)<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
 
