                <tr id="issuerow13042116" rel="13042116" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-3681" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-3681" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-3681">PDFBOX-3681</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Text not rendered in mode 7 (3)
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 10/Feb/17 16:36 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 25/Mar/17 18:12 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 10/Feb/17 17:31 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.4            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.5,                     3.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Rendering            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        PDFBOX-2814,                                                PDFBOX-2899                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Instead of the word &quot;could&quot;, a black bar is shown.<br/>
<br/>
The cause is a flaw with caching the clipping path. The intersected clipping path is the same object as the variable &quot;lastClip&quot; so PDFBox thinks it was already set.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
