</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        PDFBOX-3753                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Setting the value for a radio button the behavior is unexpected as when setting the value the entries in {{/Opts}} need to be used is there is such entry otherwise the names for the {{On}} values in the normal appearances entries need to be used. When getting the value always the set names entry is returned.<br/>
<br/>
Also see the discussion at PDFBOX-3656.<br/>
<br/>
The {{/Opts}} entries shall only be considered when exporting or importing the AcroForm fields data.  
