IOException: Image stream is empty<br/>
    org.apache.pdfbox.pdmodel.graphics.image.SampledImageReader.getRGBImage(SampledImageReader.java:114)<br/>
    org.apache.pdfbox.pdmodel.graphics.image.PDInlineImage.getImage(PDInlineImage.java:344)<br/>
