    org.apache.pdfbox.contentstream.PDFStreamEngine.processOperator(PDFStreamEngine.java:853)<br/>
{code}<br/>
Unlike in PDFBOX-2237 the inline image is really empty:<br/>
{code}<br/>
BI<br/>
/CS/G<br/>
/W 2<br/>
/H 1<br/>
/BPC 8<br/>
ID EI<br/>
EI<br/>
{code}<br/>
Solution: warn and skip.
