                                            <td class="description">      We are using the code snippet which is  attached herewith(IssueDetails.txt),  which is causing very frequent OutOfMemory in Production where a large volume of documents are processed each day.<br/>
We are using pdfbox-2.0.2.jar<br/>
<br/>
We are seeing the following warning in our logs:<br/>
COSDocument W org.apache.pdfbox.cos.COSDocument finalize Warning: You did not close a PDF Document<br/>
<br/>
Heap dump analysis points PDFBox as amajor suspect for memory leak.<br/>
The heap dump snipped is provided in the file attached(IssueDetails.txt).<br/>
<br/>
Please provide some help on this.<br/>
<br/>

