    org.apache.pdfbox.debugger.PDFDebugger.readPDFFile(PDFDebugger.java:1266)<br/>
    org.apache.pdfbox.debugger.PDFDebugger.main(PDFDebugger.java:254)<br/>
    org.apache.pdfbox.tools.PDFBox.main(PDFBox.java:85)<br/>
{code}<br/>
This worked in 2.0.4. Files with the same issue (not attached):<br/>
