</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      For the 2.0.x releases {{FDFField.getValue()}} doesn&#39;t neither return the documented {{PDTextStream}} return type nor {{String}} for values of type {{COSString}} or {{COSStream}}. This has somewhat be masked by another issue fixed in PDFBOX-3596. <br/>
<br/>
As {{PDTextStream}} is no longer available we should return as {{String}} (which is inline with {{PDField}}) and adjust the javadoc accordingly.
