                                            <td class="environment">      linux
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      the parser uses &quot;readSimpleDict&quot; to parse the Metrics.<br/>
This allows<br/>
/Metrics 100 dict dup begin ....... end def<br/>
but not<br/>
/Metrics 100 dict def Metrics begin ..... end<br/>
This variant seems to work in most other pdf tools, however
