                <tr id="issuerow13058282" rel="13058282" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-3730" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-3730" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-3730">PDFBOX-3730</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Encapsulate outputStream into BufferedOutputStream in PDDocument.save()
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Tilman Hausherr
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Peter Pinnau
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Peter Pinnau
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 22/Mar/17 16:05 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> 20/Jun/17 06:16 </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 15/May/17 20:28 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 23/Mar/17 19:50 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.5            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.6,                     3.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Documentation,                     Writing            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">3</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        PDFBOX-3121                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I recognized very slow performance of PDDocument.save() with a FileOutputStream over a VPN connection.<br/>
I did some testing and found out that using PDDocument.save(File file) solved the issue. So the BufferedInputStream makes the difference.<br/>
<br/>
Since my document API uses streams I encapsulate the OutputStream in a BufferedOutputStream if neccessary:<br/>
<br/>
if (!(outputStream instanceof BufferedOutputStream)) {<br/>
   outputStream = new BufferedOutputStream(outputStream);<br/>
}<br/>
<br/>
pdDocument.save(outputStream);<br/>
<br/>
PDDocument.load() already does that with the InputStream. So I wonder if that would be an improvement for save(), too?<br/>

  </td>
