                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The attached file contains this in the ASCII parts of its type1 fonts:<br/>
{code}<br/>
%!FontType1-1.0:  <br/>
13 dict begin<br/>
/FontInfo 2 dict dup begin<br/>
/GlyphNames2HostCode &lt;&lt;<br/>
&gt;&gt; def<br/>
/GlyphNames2Unicode &lt;&lt;<br/>
&gt;&gt; def<br/>
end readonly def<br/>
{code}<br/>
PDFBox and (probably PDF.js) choke on the empty postscript dictionary. So I&#39;ll add parsing of empty dictionaries.
