    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-3758" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-3758">PDFBOX-3758</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Add support for OTF/PostScript subsetting
    </p>
</td>
