                <tr id="issuerow13066289" rel="13066289" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-3764" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-3764" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-3764">PDFBOX-3764</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                100 times performance hit on creating images
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Invalid
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Daniel Persson
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Daniel Persson
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 24/Apr/17 10:01 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 24/Apr/17 16:17 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 24/Apr/17 10:51 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.6            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Rendering            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">5</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      We found that PDFBox creates a better image than poppler so we wanted to switch out our environment to get these improvements but found a file that took about 10 minutes to create one image with PDFBox and only about 6 seconds with poppler. So a 100 times performance hit if we where to change.<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;ve done some rudimentary profiling on the code and found that most of the time is spent in ColorConvertOp.filter. Maybe there is a leaner way to implement this in order to get a better result?<br/>
<br/>
best regards<br/>
Daniel
  </td>
