                <tr id="issuerow13070062" rel="13070062" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-3782" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-3782" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-3782">PDFBOX-3782</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Text extraction loses whitespace
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Tony Bray
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Tony Bray
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 08/May/17 17:01 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 10/May/17 15:58 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.4,                     2.0.5,                     2.0.6            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Text extraction            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Java/Tika
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I have a PDF document that I am using Tika/PDFBox to extract the content.  In several areas, the content extracted loses the whitespace, causing a tokenization problem for indexing/searching.  <br/>
<br/>
I have attached the original document and the text output.  If you search (Ctrl+f) the text document for &quot;Another example&quot;.  Here you will see no space after &quot;is&quot; and the Japanese text.  The same issue shows for &quot;whichmeans&quot;eraser&quot;&quot; at the end of the sentence.  <br/>
Another example is消しゴム (Rō- maji: keshigomu) whichmeans“eraser”<br/>
<br/>
I get the warning &quot;WARNING: No Unicode mapping for CID+0 (0) in font RGOFPX+IPAexMincho&quot; during extraction but have been unable to find any information on it.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimespent"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="labels">    </td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12310220">            <span title="08/May/17 21:40"><time class="livestamp allow-future" datetime="2017-05-08T21:40:05+0000">08/May/17 9:40 PM</time></span>
