<br/>
These are the rendering times as displayed in the status area of PDFDebugger for each of the attached files:<br/>
<br/>
0to25.pdf: 22.095 seconds<br/>
25to50.pdf: 33.726 seconds<br/>
0to50.pdf: 67.481 seconds<br/>
<br/>

