  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi,<br/>
<br/>
I am quite unfamiliar with PDFbox. Still, I spent some time trying to figure out to solve the following issue.<br/>
<br/>
There is an issue for the pdf in attachment while extracting its text. Indeed, as you can see the pdf  contains the text &quot;Mapping Twitter topic networks: ... &quot; until &quot;... hub and spokes&quot;. But the result of PDFTextStripper getText() does not contain any of these characters.<br/>
<br/>
I checked and the community has already fixed similar bugs in the past.<br/>
<br/>
Any help will be delighted.<br/>
<br/>
Cheers,<br/>
A.
