</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        PDFBOX-2917                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Gentoo, Ubuntu
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      We found that some images in our pdf flow didn&#39;t have the correct colors after extraction.<br/>
<br/>
After some investigation it seemed that we had the same problem with both poppler and pdfbox. We found a solution for poppler where we recompiled it with version 2.8 of Little CMS.<br/>
<br/>
The images in this issue was created with these commands:<br/>
<br/>
```<br/>
java -jar pdfbox-app-2.1.0-SNAPSHOT.jar PDFToImage -imageType png test.pdf<br/>
```<br/>
<br/>
```<br/>
pdftoppm test.pdf -png poppler<br/>
```<br/>
<br/>
Best regards<br/>
Daniel
