</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      While processing todays batch of data we got a Nullpointer exception in getLeftSideBearing. Sadly I can&#39;t give you the PDF.<br/>
<br/>
```<br/>
    public int getLeftSideBearing(int gid) {<br/>
        return gid &lt; this.numHMetrics?this.leftSideBearing[gid]:this.nonHorizontalLeftSideBearing[gid - this.numHMetrics];<br/>
    }<br/>
```<br/>
<br/>
In this function there could be a case where nonHorizontalLeftSideBearing is null and you still ask for a GID in larger or equal to numHMetrics.<br/>
<br/>
First time I see this issue and so far only 4 characters in one PDF has this issue so not critical.
  </td>
