                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Is it possible to show emoji icons from the iOS library in the PDF document?
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Wish</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Won&#39;t Fix
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Mikhail Semionenko
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Mikhail Semionenko
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 26/May/17 09:05 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 30/May/17 16:37 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 30/May/17 16:37 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I want to show emoji (like 😍) in the pdf document. Is it possible to do something like that?
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
